{"message":"feat(source): refine constrained matches with checked constructor equations\n\nShare the admitted case-elimination backend with ordinary source match.\nRetain original branch syntax, checked discriminants and dependent scopes.\nSupport fixed/repeated indices, dependent results, nested matches, inferred\nresult types, implicit fields and reachable catch-all alternatives. Omitted\nconstructors require actual contradiction proofs; unknown equations and\nsupplied impossible alternatives do not justify silently erasing source.\n\nSeparate observing a recursive root match from consuming it, preserving\nexisting structural recursion. No new axiom, dependency or admission door.\nAdd fourteen source regressions and an installed CLI test. Local five-package\nrun: 1614 top-level tests pass, zero failed or ignored; scoped Clippy,\nworkspace all-target compilation and changed-file formatting pass.\nRemote gates repeat before publication. Related: fln-qb5, fln-kpd.","length":43588,"sha256":"540d0e73407645a462764d10595d3b31ce048b434f94907d7c5068fb06a0e4df","parts":["ea2e20162dd4a3f45033de242236df16e95f1d35","ef147afccfcdd38f531ede98559a268c12b27156","ec8da4ff150bb48ff7e2fd0ee451a0151804920a","d66e37a91c55952bdd0afdfd8e9717aa1afb3263"],"base_blobs":{"crates/fln-cli/tests/source_check.rs":"1574a4e86477fb50a3a1fa200bd512b201c8d3a4","crates/fln-elab/src/source.rs":"97921a133d5d21283c8e81a4da166c263500dd9d","crates/fln-elab/src/source/matching.rs":"43c2f7ad74571b845e7002aefc867b387add9a20","crates/fln-elab/src/source/recursion.rs":"07112821f10188dda09287cb00a4f92a703e4ca1","crates/fln-elab/src/source/tactics.rs":"f4b2336208af4ed85bd22a902599fb5574914520","crates/fln-elab/src/source/tactics/eliminate.rs":"74e27644173f6fd204f2633ac172e9e7603be30a","crates/fln-elab/src/source/tactics/index_equations.rs":"c6a80d6b292b14f3a1857b2b557e617efc2ff4e1","crates/fln/tests/source_index_refinement.rs":"b43dca148404c66fe1d6823db2e714dc63a195a5","docs/NATIVE_INDEX_REFINEMENT.md":"c25139978